  "description": "A zero-dependency, deterministic toolkit of classic (non-neural, CPU-only) pattern-discovery and data-mining algorithms for .NET: frequent itemsets and association rules, sequential and episode mining, process mining, clustering, anomaly detection, graph mining, causal-structure tests, time-series motifs, and more. Speak in your own labels through the fluent on-ramp; the integer encoding the analyzers require is handled for you. Every algorithm is validated against planted-truth datasets.",
